            <ArticleTitle>Life-threatening complications of betamimetic therapy for preterm labor inhibition.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>843-52</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Betamimetic administration for inhibition of preterm labor can result in a number of severe complications for the mother. An understanding of clinical situations that increase the risk of complications and suggested treatment of adverse effects are discussed in this review.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
